|---------|----------------|
| **Map embed** | An `<iframe>` centered on the State Library (34.052235, ‑118.243683) with zoom 15 and roadmap style. |
| **State Library marker** | Added via `new google.maps.Marker()` with the title “State Library”. |
| **Three circles** | Each circle is drawn with a 100 m radius (you can change the `radius` value) and styled in semi‑transparent red. The circles are placed at: <br>• (34.052235, ‑118.243683) <br>• (34.053690, ‑118.2423732) <br>• (34.05381, ‑118.242751) |
| **API key** | Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with a valid Google Maps JavaScript API key. |

